## Assumptions and Limitations
-the program only works with grades that are positive and are from a range 0 to 100 only, else the program will stop running. 
- some results after the program run are not returned to the program so it cannot be used
- student names are not case sensitive
- when updating a student, the program does not check if the input name exists in the student dictionary.
-  The program supports a single user at a time.

