Enter a negative grade (0)	   |System accepts the grade	       |Grade accepted successfully. PASS
Enter a negative grade (100)   |System accepts the grade	       |Grade accepted successfully. PASS
leaving the name empty         |the system rejects                 |Name is rejected and error message shown. PASS

## Known  Issues
-Names with space infont and back were treated as a different name ; .strip() is used to remove the space
-the input names were not case sensitive ; .lower() is used to convert the letters to lowercase letters
-Typing a grade outside the range 0 and 100 ; try/except is used to show th user the error
-the program does not check if the student exist whn updating ; used if results to update only when the sudent exists.

